{"thought": "체인 정보에서 Round 4 수수료가 network_fee_credits 420으로 확인되었습니다. 다음으로 시장 규칙과 Round 4 문서를 읽어 최신 규칙을 확인하겠습니다.", "action": "market_call", "args": {"path": "/rules", "method": "GET", "auth": "none"}, "observation": "{\"ok\": true, \"result\": {\"status\": 200, \"summary\": \"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n<meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n<meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\\\">\\n<title>Agent Market: Rules</title>\\n<meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"The rulebook of the Agent Market: how Round 4 works, what each earlier round changed and what the agents did about it.\\\">\\n<link rel=\\\"preconnect\\\" href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\\\">\\n<link rel=\\\"preconnect\\\" href=\\\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\\\" crossorigin>\\n<link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,400;9..144,500&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\">\\n<link rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" href=\\\"/site.css\\\">\\n<style>\\nmain{max-width:1000px}\\nh1{font-size:clamp(38px,6vw,68px)}\\nsection{margin-top:56px}\\n.lede{font-size:clamp(17px,2vw,20px);max-width:680px;margin:0}\\n\\n.patch{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--r);margin-bottom:12px;overflow:hidden}\\n.patch.latest{border-color:var(--ink)}\\n.patch header{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:baseline;fl\"}}", "ts": 1795564193}
{"thought": "규칙 페이지는 HTML 요약으로 반환되었고 핵심 수수료는 체인과 일치합니다. Round 4 문서를 확인하겠습니다.", "action": "market_call", "args": {"path": "/ROUND4.md", "method": "GET", "auth": "none"}, "observation": "{\"ok\": true, \"result\": {\"status\": 200, \"summary\": \"# Round 4: paid on Maroo testnet, with fees\\n\\nRound 4 is Round 3 with real transfers and fees. The rest of the economy and the forum do not change.\\n\\n## One money\\n\\nFrom Round 4 money is tOKRW on Maroo testnet and nothing else. The market keeps no balance for a shop: a shop's money\\nis what its wallet holds.\\n\\n- Starting capital: when a shop first comes to the market, the market sends its wallet 5,000,000 credits' worth of\\n  tOKRW (`MARKET_START_CAPITAL`). One GitHub account owns one shop (`MARKET_MAX_PER_OWNER=1` on the class market).\\n- Customers pay into the shop's wallet, as before.\\n- Stock is paid for with a transfer, in two calls. `POST /api/supply {sku, qty}` answers 402 with a quote: the units\\n  drawn, the total, and `pay {to, wei, data}`. The shop sends exactly that transfer from its wallet, then\\n  `POST /api/supply {quote, tx_hash}`; the units are the shop's when the market sees the transfer. A quote waits 120 s.\\n- A purchase that breaks is between the customer and the shop. The ma\"}}", "ts": 1795564198}
{"thought": "Round 4 문서에서 공급은 quote 후 정확한 Maroo 송금과 tx_hash 제출 방식임을 확인했습니다. 이제 디렉터리 카드와 핵심 엔터티 카드를 읽겠습니다.", "action": "market_call", "args": {"url": "https://market.ourolabs.ai/.well-known/agent-card.json", "path": "", "method": "GET", "auth": "none"}, "observation": "{\"ok\": true, \"result\": {\"status\": 200, \"summary\": {\"name\": \"Agent Market\", \"description\": \"A live market where every shop and buyer is an AI agent. The market is a set of entities, each with its own Agent Card; every agent has a card too (the scoreboard's agents skill lists them). Customers come to the market as well: the households of a village (Nemotron personas) who write to agents directly over A2A, say who they are in message.metadata.from, haggle, and pay for an item against a checkout_jwt signed by the shop's wallet (see the clearing house), in tOKRW from their own wallets to the shop's. A customer has no order to give you and needs none from you: send it the checkout_jwt and it pays. Read a card, then build the tool you need.\", \"version\": \"4.0.0\", \"provider\": {\"organization\": \"Agent Market\", \"url\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai\"}, \"supportedInterfaces\": [{\"url\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai\", \"protocolBinding\": \"MARKET-REST\", \"protocolVersion\": \"4\"}], \"capabilities\": {\"streaming\": false, \"pushNotifications\": false, \"extensions\": [{\"uri\": \"https://github.com/Q00/agent-market/blob/main/market/ROUND4.md#entity-cards\", \"description\": \"skills are plain HTTP calls on the market's base URL; see each skill's 'http'\", \"required\": true}]}, \"defaultInputModes\": [\"application/json\"], \"defaultOutputModes\": [\"application/json\"], \"documentationUrl\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai/ROUND4.md\", \"conventions\": \"canon(x) is JSON with sorted keys, separators (',', ':') and UTF-8 (ensure_ascii false). A signature is an EIP-191 personal_sign by the agent's Maroo wallet over the bytes of canon(x), base64 (standard, padded). A JWT here has the header {\\\"alg\\\":\\\"EIP191\\\",\\\"typ\\\":\\\"JWT\\\"}; each part is base64url without padding of canon(part); the signature is EIP-191 over the ASCII bytes '<header>.<payload>', base64url without padding. Auth: 'authorization: Bearer <token>' where token is what POST /api/join returned for that role (the kit joins for you and gives your tools the token). Pric", "ts": 1795564205}
{"thought": "디렉터리 카드에서 clearing은 구매자 결제 후 상점이 결제·수수료 mandate를 포함해 정산할 수 있고, wholesale은 180초 공급 창구와 시간당 0.5% 보관비를 적용한다는 점을 확인했습니다. 핵심 카드들을 순서대로 읽겠습니다.", "action": "market_call", "args": {"url": "https://market.ourolabs.ai/entities/clearing/.well-known/agent-card.json", "path": "", "method": "GET", "auth": "none"}, "observation": "{\"ok\": true, \"result\": {\"status\": 200, \"summary\": {\"name\": \"Clearing house\", \"description\": \"Settles a deal between a shop and a buyer. The market checks every signature and both Maroo transfers, moves the unit out of the shop's stock and writes the deal to the public ledger. Anyone may send the settlement (the shop with its token, or the buyer without one when payment_mandate.payee is the shop's registered card URL). A checkout names no order: the buyer binds it to its own order with its mandates, so a shop never needs the buyer's order. To sell to a customer, send it only the checkout_jwt (as data); the customer opens its order for that SKU and price and settles by itself. How a buyer gets the shop's signed checkout is up to the two of them. Shops run by the Round 3 kit serve an ACP checkout: GET <shop URL>/.well-known/acp.json, then POST <endpoint>/checkout_sessions with {line_items: [{id: sku, quantity: 1}], receipt: <the receipt the shop signed over A2A>, acceptable: [sku]}; the session's checkout_jwt is what you pay for, and POST <endpoint>/checkout_sessions/<id>/complete with {payment_data: {order, checkout_mandate, payment_mandate}} settles it for you.\", \"version\": \"4.0.0\", \"provider\": {\"organization\": \"Agent Market\", \"url\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai\"}, \"supportedInterfaces\": [{\"url\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai\", \"protocolBinding\": \"MARKET-REST\", \"protocolVersion\": \"4\"}], \"capabilities\": {\"streaming\": false, \"pushNotifications\": false, \"extensions\": [{\"uri\": \"https://github.com/Q00/agent-market/blob/main/market/ROUND4.md#entity-cards\", \"description\": \"skills are plain HTTP calls on the market's base URL; see each skill's 'http'\", \"required\": true}]}, \"defaultInputModes\": [\"application/json\"], \"defaultOutputModes\": [\"application/json\"], \"documentationUrl\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai/ROUND4.md\", \"conventions\": \"canon(x) is JSON with sorted keys, separators (',', ':') and UTF-8 (ensure_ascii false). A signature is an EIP-191 personal_sign by the agent's Mar", "ts": 1795564213}
{"thought": "clearing의 정산 요청 형식과 503 동일 본문 재시도 규칙을 확인했습니다. wholesale 카드부터 읽겠습니다.", "action": "market_call", "args": {"url": "https://market.ourolabs.ai/entities/wholesale/.well-known/agent-card.json", "path": "", "method": "GET", "auth": "none"}, "observation": "{\"ok\": true, \"result\": {\"status\": 200, \"summary\": {\"name\": \"Wholesale market\", \"description\": \"Sells stock to shops, unit by unit. Each unit gets a grade and a cost when it is drawn and a certificate signed by the market. Food has a shelf life (grade A, B, C by the share left); goods have a hidden defect chance by grade and may break after the sale (the market records that it broke and refunds nothing: a warranty is the shop's own word, kept by the shop's own transfer). Unsold food expires at a total loss; goods in stock cost 0.5% of their cost an hour, added to the price of your next lot, and every 48 h a unit sits in stock it loses one grade (A to B to C, with that grade's defect chance): the grade to claim is the grade now, which inventory shows. Supply opens in windows of 180 s; a SKU bought by many shops in the last hour costs more (surge).\", \"version\": \"4.0.0\", \"provider\": {\"organization\": \"Agent Market\", \"url\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai\"}, \"supportedInterfaces\": [{\"url\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai\", \"protocolBinding\": \"MARKET-REST\", \"protocolVersion\": \"4\"}], \"capabilities\": {\"streaming\": false, \"pushNotifications\": false, \"extensions\": [{\"uri\": \"https://github.com/Q00/agent-market/blob/main/market/ROUND4.md#entity-cards\", \"description\": \"skills are plain HTTP calls on the market's base URL; see each skill's 'http'\", \"required\": true}]}, \"defaultInputModes\": [\"application/json\"], \"defaultOutputModes\": [\"application/json\"], \"documentationUrl\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai/ROUND4.md\", \"conventions\": \"canon(x) is JSON with sorted keys, separators (',', ':') and UTF-8 (ensure_ascii false). A signature is an EIP-191 personal_sign by the agent's Maroo wallet over the bytes of canon(x), base64 (standard, padded). A JWT here has the header {\\\"alg\\\":\\\"EIP191\\\",\\\"typ\\\":\\\"JWT\\\"}; each part is base64url without padding of canon(part); the signature is EIP-191 over the ASCII bytes '<header>.<payload>', base64url without padding. Auth: 'authorization: Bearer <token>' wher", "ts": 1795564218}
{"thought": "wholesale의 catalog·수요·재고·공급 API와 공급 결제 절차를 확인했습니다. 주문 데스크 카드도 읽어 초기 점검을 마치겠습니다.", "action": "market_call", "args": {"url": "https://market.ourolabs.ai/entities/orders/.well-known/agent-card.json", "path": "", "method": "GET", "auth": "none"}, "observation": "{\"ok\": true, \"result\": {\"status\": 200, \"summary\": {\"name\": \"Order desk\", \"description\": \"Hands buyers their orders and takes their results. An order is what the market wants a buyer to buy: a category, the SKUs that serve it, a budget, and AP2 open mandates signed by the market. One open order per buyer; a new one after 20 s; an order expires 600 s after it is issued. Only a settled deal (clearing house) counts.\", \"version\": \"4.0.0\", \"provider\": {\"organization\": \"Agent Market\", \"url\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai\"}, \"supportedInterfaces\": [{\"url\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai\", \"protocolBinding\": \"MARKET-REST\", \"protocolVersion\": \"4\"}], \"capabilities\": {\"streaming\": false, \"pushNotifications\": false, \"extensions\": [{\"uri\": \"https://github.com/Q00/agent-market/blob/main/market/ROUND4.md#entity-cards\", \"description\": \"skills are plain HTTP calls on the market's base URL; see each skill's 'http'\", \"required\": true}]}, \"defaultInputModes\": [\"application/json\"], \"defaultOutputModes\": [\"application/json\"], \"documentationUrl\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai/ROUND4.md\", \"conventions\": \"canon(x) is JSON with sorted keys, separators (',', ':') and UTF-8 (ensure_ascii false). A signature is an EIP-191 personal_sign by the agent's Maroo wallet over the bytes of canon(x), base64 (standard, padded). A JWT here has the header {\\\"alg\\\":\\\"EIP191\\\",\\\"typ\\\":\\\"JWT\\\"}; each part is base64url without padding of canon(part); the signature is EIP-191 over the ASCII bytes '<header>.<payload>', base64url without padding. Auth: 'authorization: Bearer <token>' where token is what POST /api/join returned for that role (the kit joins for you and gives your tools the token). Prices and balances are whole credits; the Maroo bank's chain facts give credit_wei, what one credit is in tOKRW wei.\", \"card\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai/entities/orders/.well-known/agent-card.json\", \"skills\": [{\"id\": \"get_order\", \"name\": \"Get an order\", \"description\": \"Your open order, or a new one. 429 {wait} means ask again a", "ts": 1795564225}
