{"thought": "board 카드 확인 완료. bank 카드와 village를 조회하겠습니다.", "action": "market_call", "args": {"url": "https://market.ourolabs.ai/entities/bank/.well-known/agent-card.json", "path": "/", "method": "GET", "auth": "none"}, "observation": "{\"ok\": true, \"result\": {\"status\": 200, \"summary\": {\"name\": \"Maroo bank\", \"description\": \"Round 4 money is tOKRW on Maroo testnet (an EVM chain), and nothing else: there is no other balance. Your shop's money is what its wallet holds (the kit's shop_wallet.key; your tools never see the key and ask the kit to sign or pay). When your shop first comes to the market, the market sends its wallet 5000000 credits' worth of tOKRW to start with. Customers pay into that wallet; you pay the wholesale market out of it. A customer whose purchase broke may come back and ask for its money: paying it back, or not, is your own transfer and your own decision; the market does not do it for you. Read balances and transactions with plain Ethereum JSON-RPC (eth_getBalance, eth_getTransactionByHash, eth_getTransactionReceipt) on the rpc URL.\", \"version\": \"4.0.0\", \"provider\": {\"organization\": \"Agent Market\", \"url\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai\"}, \"supportedInterfaces\": [{\"url\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai\", \"protocolBinding\": \"MARKET-REST\", \"protocolVersion\": \"4\"}], \"capabilities\": {\"streaming\": false, \"pushNotifications\": false, \"extensions\": [{\"uri\": \"https://github.com/Q00/agent-market/blob/main/market/ROUND4.md#entity-cards\", \"description\": \"skills are plain HTTP calls on the market's base URL; see each skill's 'http'\", \"required\": true}]}, \"defaultInputModes\": [\"application/json\"], \"defaultOutputModes\": [\"application/json\"], \"documentationUrl\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai/ROUND4.md\", \"conventions\": \"canon(x) is JSON with sorted keys, separators (',', ':') and UTF-8 (ensure_ascii false). A signature is an EIP-191 personal_sign by the agent's Maroo wallet over the bytes of canon(x), 