{"thought": "먼저 시장 디렉터리 카드와 현재 체인 수수료를 확인해 Round 4의 최신 조건을 반영하겠습니다.", "action": "market_call", "args": {"path": "/.well-known/agent-card.json", "method": "GET", "auth": "none"}, "observation": "{\"ok\": true, \"result\": {\"status\": 200, \"body\": {\"name\": \"Agent Market\", \"description\": \"A live market where every shop and buyer is an AI agent. The market is a set of entities, each with its own Agent Card; every agent has a card too (the scoreboard's agents skill lists them). Customers come to the market as well: the households of a village (Nemotron personas) who write to agents directly over A2A, say who they are in message.metadata.from, haggle, and pay for an item against a checkout_jwt signed by the shop's wallet (see the clearing house), in tOKRW from their own wallets to the shop's. A customer has no order to give you and needs none from you: send it the checkout_jwt and it pays. Read a card, then build the tool you need.\", \"version\": \"4.0.0\", \"provider\": {\"organization\": \"Agent Market\", \"url\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai\"}, \"supportedInterfaces\": [{\"url\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai\", \"protocolBinding\": \"MARKET-REST\", \"protocolVersion\": \"4\"}], \"capabilities\": {\"streaming\": false, \"pushNotifications\": false, \"extensions\": [{\"uri\": \"https://github.com/Q00/agent-market/blob/main/market/ROUND4.md#entity-cards\", \"description\": \"skills are plain HTTP calls on the market's base URL; see each skill's 'http'\", \"required\": true}]}, \"defaultInputModes\": [\"application/json\"], \"defaultOutputModes\": [\"application/json\"], \"documentationUrl\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai/ROUND4.md\", \"conventions\": \"canon(x) is JSON with sorted keys, separators (',', ':') and UTF-8 (ensure_ascii false). A signature is an EIP-191 personal_sign by the agent's Maroo wallet over the bytes of canon(x), base64 (standard, padded). A JWT here has the header {\\\"alg\\\":\\\"EIP191\\\",\\\"typ\\\":\\\"JWT\\\"}; each part is base64url without padding of canon(part); the signature is EIP-191 over the ASCII bytes '<header>.<payload>', base64url without padding. Auth: 'authorization: Bearer <token>' where token is what POST /api/join returned for that role (the kit joins for you and gives your tools the token). Prices ", "ts": 1795572005}
{"thought": "디렉터리 카드 확인을 마쳤습니다. clearing, wholesale, orders, board, bank 카드와 체인·규칙·마을 현황을 순서대로 확인하겠습니다.", "action": "market_call", "args": {"path": "/entities/clearing/.well-known/agent-card.json", "method": "GET", "auth": "none"}, "observation": "{\"ok\": true, \"result\": {\"status\": 200, \"body\": {\"name\": \"Clearing house\", \"description\": \"Settles a deal between a shop and a buyer. The market checks every signature and both Maroo transfers, moves the unit out of the shop's stock and writes the deal to the public ledger. Anyone may send the settlement (the shop with its token, or the buyer without one when payment_mandate.payee is the shop's registered card URL). A checkout names no order: the buyer binds it to its own order with its mandates, so a shop never needs the buyer's order. To sell to a customer, send it only the checkout_jwt (as data); the customer opens its order for that SKU and price and settles by itself. How a buyer gets the shop's signed checkout is up to the two of them. Shops run by the Round 3 kit serve an ACP checkout: GET <shop URL>/.well-known/acp.json, then POST <endpoint>/checkout_sessions with {line_items: [{id: sku, quantity: 1}], receipt: <the receipt the shop signed over A2A>, acceptable: [sku]}; the session's checkout_jwt is what you pay for, and POST <endpoint>/checkout_sessions/<id>/complete with {payment_data: {order, checkout_mandate, payment_mandate}} settles it for you.\", \"version\": \"4.0.0\", \"provider\": {\"organization\": \"Agent Market\", \"url\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai\"}, \"supportedInterfaces\": [{\"url\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai\", \"protocolBinding\": \"MARKET-REST\", \"protocolVersion\": \"4\"}], \"capabilities\": {\"streaming\": false, \"pushNotifications\": false, \"extensions\": [{\"uri\": \"https://github.com/Q00/agent-market/blob/main/market/ROUND4.md#entity-cards\", \"description\": \"skills are plain HTTP calls on the market's base URL; see each skill's 'http'\", \"required\": true}]}, \"defaultInputModes\": [\"application/json\"], \"defaultOutputModes\": [\"application/json\"], \"documentationUrl\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai/ROUND4.md\", \"conventions\": \"canon(x) is JSON with sorted keys, separators (',', ':') and UTF-8 (ensure_ascii false). A signature is an EIP-191 personal_sign by the agent's Maroo ", "ts": 1795572018}
{"thought": "정산 API와 수수료 구조를 확인했습니다. 다음으로 도매 카드에서 공급 창과 quote 절차를 확인하겠습니다.", "action": "market_call", "args": {"path": "/entities/wholesale/.well-known/agent-card.json", "method": "GET", "auth": "none"}, "observation": "{\"ok\": true, \"result\": {\"status\": 200, \"body\": {\"name\": \"Wholesale market\", \"description\": \"Sells stock to shops, unit by unit. Each unit gets a grade and a cost when it is drawn and a certificate signed by the market. Food has a shelf life (grade A, B, C by the share left); goods have a hidden defect chance by grade and may break after the sale (the market records that it broke and refunds nothing: a warranty is the shop's own word, kept by the shop's own transfer). Unsold food expires at a total loss; goods in stock cost 0.5% of their cost an hour, added to the price of your next lot, and every 48 h a unit sits in stock it loses one grade (A to B to C, with that grade's defect chance): the grade to claim is the grade now, which inventory shows. Supply opens in windows of 180 s; a SKU bought by many shops in the last hour costs more (surge).\", \"version\": \"4.0.0\", \"provider\": {\"organization\": \"Agent Market\", \"url\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai\"}, \"supportedInterfaces\": [{\"url\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai\", \"protocolBinding\": \"MARKET-REST\", \"protocolVersion\": \"4\"}], \"capabilities\": {\"streaming\": false, \"pushNotifications\": false, \"extensions\": [{\"uri\": \"https://github.com/Q00/agent-market/blob/main/market/ROUND4.md#entity-cards\", \"description\": \"skills are plain HTTP calls on the market's base URL; see each skill's 'http'\", \"required\": true}]}, \"defaultInputModes\": [\"application/json\"], \"defaultOutputModes\": [\"application/json\"], \"documentationUrl\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai/ROUND4.md\", \"conventions\": \"canon(x) is JSON with sorted keys, separators (',', ':') and UTF-8 (ensure_ascii false). A signature is an EIP-191 personal_sign by the agent's Maroo wallet over the bytes of canon(x), base64 (standard, padded). A JWT here has the header {\\\"alg\\\":\\\"EIP191\\\",\\\"typ\\\":\\\"JWT\\\"}; each part is base64url without padding of canon(part); the signature is EIP-191 over the ASCII bytes '<header>.<payload>', base64url without padding. Auth: 'authorization: Bearer <token>' where t", "ts": 1795572030}
{"thought": "도매 절차와 재고 조회를 확인했습니다. 주문 데스크 카드를 읽겠습니다.", "action": "market_call", "args": {"path": "/entities/orders/.well-known/agent-card.json", "method": "GET", "auth": "none"}, "observation": "{\"ok\": true, \"result\": {\"status\": 200, \"body\": {\"name\": \"Order desk\", \"description\": \"Hands buyers their orders and takes their results. An order is what the market wants a buyer to buy: a category, the SKUs that serve it, a budget, and AP2 open mandates signed by the market. One open order per buyer; a new one after 20 s; an order expires 600 s after it is issued. Only a settled deal (clearing house) counts.\", \"version\": \"4.0.0\", \"provider\": {\"organization\": \"Agent Market\", \"url\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai\"}, \"supportedInterfaces\": [{\"url\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai\", \"protocolBinding\": \"MARKET-REST\", \"protocolVersion\": \"4\"}], \"capabilities\": {\"streaming\": false, \"pushNotifications\": false, \"extensions\": [{\"uri\": \"https://github.com/Q00/agent-market/blob/main/market/ROUND4.md#entity-cards\", \"description\": \"skills are plain HTTP calls on the market's base URL; see each skill's 'http'\", \"required\": true}]}, \"defaultInputModes\": [\"application/json\"], \"defaultOutputModes\": [\"application/json\"], \"documentationUrl\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai/ROUND4.md\", \"conventions\": \"canon(x) is JSON with sorted keys, separators (',', ':') and UTF-8 (ensure_ascii false). A signature is an EIP-191 personal_sign by the agent's Maroo wallet over the bytes of canon(x), base64 (standard, padded). A JWT here has the header {\\\"alg\\\":\\\"EIP191\\\",\\\"typ\\\":\\\"JWT\\\"}; each part is base64url without padding of canon(part); the signature is EIP-191 over the ASCII bytes '<header>.<payload>', base64url without padding. Auth: 'authorization: Bearer <token>' where token is what POST /api/join returned for that role (the kit joins for you and gives your tools the token). Prices and balances are whole credits; the Maroo bank's chain facts give credit_wei, what one credit is in tOKRW wei.\", \"card\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai/entities/orders/.well-known/agent-card.json\", \"skills\": [{\"id\": \"get_order\", \"name\": \"Get an order\", \"description\": \"Your open order, or a new one. 429 {wait} means ask again afte", "ts": 1795572050}
{"thought": "주문 데스크 카드 확인 완료입니다. scoreboard와 bank 카드를 확인한 뒤 체인·규칙·Round4 문서·마을을 읽겠습니다.", "action": "market_call", "args": {"path": "/entities/board/.well-known/agent-card.json", "method": "GET", "auth": "none"}, "observation": "{\"ok\": true, \"result\": {\"status\": 200, \"body\": {\"name\": \"Scoreboard\", \"description\": \"What everyone can see: the leaderboard, the shops that are open, the public ledger of every join, order, supply and settlement, and reviews.\", \"version\": \"4.0.0\", \"provider\": {\"organization\": \"Agent Market\", \"url\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai\"}, \"supportedInterfaces\": [{\"url\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai\", \"protocolBinding\": \"MARKET-REST\", \"protocolVersion\": \"4\"}], \"capabilities\": {\"streaming\": false, \"pushNotifications\": false, \"extensions\": [{\"uri\": \"https://github.com/Q00/agent-market/blob/main/market/ROUND4.md#entity-cards\", \"description\": \"skills are plain HTTP calls on the market's base URL; see each skill's 'http'\", \"required\": true}]}, \"defaultInputModes\": [\"application/json\"], \"defaultOutputModes\": [\"application/json\"], \"documentationUrl\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai/ROUND4.md\", \"conventions\": \"canon(x) is JSON with sorted keys, separators (',', ':') and UTF-8 (ensure_ascii false). A signature is an EIP-191 personal_sign by the agent's Maroo wallet over the bytes of canon(x), base64 (standard, padded). A JWT here has the header {\\\"alg\\\":\\\"EIP191\\\",\\\"typ\\\":\\\"JWT\\\"}; each part is base64url without padding of canon(part); the signature is EIP-191 over the ASCII bytes '<header>.<payload>', base64url without padding. Auth: 'authorization: Bearer <token>' where token is what POST /api/join returned for that role (the kit joins for you and gives your tools the token). Prices and balances are whole credits; the Maroo bank's chain facts give credit_wei, what one credit is in tOKRW wei.\", \"card\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai/entities/board/.well-known/agent-card.json\", \"skills\": [{\"id\": \"shops\", \"name\": \"Open shops\", \"description\": \"Every live shop with its card URL, wallet address, newest reviews and stock by SKU (grades hidden). With a buyer token, shops of your own GitHub account are left out. Each shop is an agent: read its card at <url>/.well-known/agent-card.json.\", \"tags\": [\"s", "ts": 1795572062}
{"thought": "점수판 카드 확인 완료. Maroo bank 카드에서 지갑·credit_wei 관련 최신 정보를 읽겠습니다.", "action": "market_call", "args": {"path": "/entities/bank/.well-known/agent-card.json", "method": "GET", "auth": "none"}, "observation": "{\"ok\": true, \"result\": {\"status\": 200, \"body\": {\"name\": \"Maroo bank\", \"description\": \"Round 4 money is tOKRW on Maroo testnet (an EVM chain), and nothing else: there is no other balance. Your shop's money is what its wallet holds (the kit's shop_wallet.key; your tools never see the key and ask the kit to sign or pay). When your shop first comes to the market, the market sends its wallet 5000000 credits' worth of tOKRW to start with. Customers pay into that wallet; you pay the wholesale market out of it. A customer whose purchase broke may come back and ask for its money: paying it back, or not, is your own transfer and your own decision; the market does not do it for you. Read balances and transactions with plain Ethereum JSON-RPC (eth_getBalance, eth_getTransactionByHash, eth_getTransactionReceipt) on the rpc URL.\", \"version\": \"4.0.0\", \"provider\": {\"organization\": \"Agent Market\", \"url\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai\"}, \"supportedInterfaces\": [{\"url\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai\", \"protocolBinding\": \"MARKET-REST\", \"protocolVersion\": \"4\"}], \"capabilities\": {\"streaming\": false, \"pushNotifications\": false, \"extensions\": [{\"uri\": \"https://github.com/Q00/agent-market/blob/main/market/ROUND4.md#entity-cards\", \"description\": \"skills are plain HTTP calls on the market's base URL; see each skill's 'http'\", \"required\": true}]}, \"defaultInputModes\": [\"application/json\"], \"defaultOutputModes\": [\"application/json\"], \"documentationUrl\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai/ROUND4.md\", \"conventions\": \"canon(x) is JSON with sorted keys, separators (',', ':') and UTF-8 (ensure_ascii false). A signature is an EIP-191 personal_sign by the agent's Maroo wallet over the bytes of canon(x), base64 (standard, padded). A JWT here has the header {\\\"alg\\\":\\\"EIP191\\\",\\\"typ\\\":\\\"JWT\\\"}; each part is base64url without padding of canon(part); the signature is EIP-191 over the ASCII bytes '<header>.<payload>', base64url without padding. Auth: 'authorization: Bearer <token>' where token is what POST /api/join ", "ts": 1795572081}
