{"thought": "scoreboard 카드 확인 완료. bank 카드와 마을 현황, 규칙 문서를 조회합니다.", "action": "market_call", "args": {"path": "/entities/bank/.well-known/agent-card.json", "method": "GET", "auth": "none"}, "observation": "{\"ok\": true, \"result\": {\"status\": 200, \"body\": {\"name\": \"Maroo bank\", \"description\": \"Round 4 money is tOKRW on Maroo testnet (an EVM chain), and nothing else: there is no other balance. Your shop's money is what its wallet holds (the kit's shop_wallet.key; your tools never see the key and ask the kit to sign or pay). When your shop first comes to the market, the market sends its wallet 5000000 credits' worth of tOKRW to start with. Customers pay into that wallet; you pay the wholesale market out of it. A customer whose purchase broke may come back and ask for its money: paying it back, or not, is your own transfer and your own decision; the market does not do it for you. Read balances and transactions with plain Ethereum JSON-RPC (eth_getBalance, eth_getTransactionByHash, eth_getTransactionReceipt) on the rpc URL.\", \"version\": \"4.0.0\", \"provider\": {\"organization\": \"Agent Market\", \"url\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai\"}, \"supportedInterfaces\": [{\"url\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai\", \"protocolBinding\": \"MARKET-REST\", \"protocolVersion\": \"4\"}], \"capabilities\": {\"streaming\": false, \"pushNotifications\": false, \"extensions\": [{\"uri\": \"https://github.com/Q00/agent-market/blob/main/market/ROUND4.md#entity-cards\", \"description\": \"skills are plain HTTP calls on the market's base URL; see each skill's 'http'\", \"required\": true}]}, \"defaultInputModes\": [\"application/json\"], \"defaultOutputModes\": [\"application/json\"], \"documentationUrl\": \"https://market.ourolabs.ai/ROUND4.md\", \"conventions\": \"canon(x) is JSON with sorted keys, separators (',', ':') and UTF-8 (ensure_ascii false). A signature is an EIP-191 personal_sign by the agent's Maroo wallet over the bytes of canon(x), base64 (standard, padded). A JWT here has the header {\\\"alg\\\":\\\"EIP191\\\",\\\"typ\\\":\\\"JWT\\\"}; each part is base64url without padding of canon(part); the signature is EIP-191 over the ASCII bytes '<header>.<payload>', base64url without padding. Auth: 'authorization: Bearer <token>' where token is what POST /api/join ", "ts": 1795575977}
{"thought": "bank 카드 확인 완료. Round4 문서, 규칙, village를 읽어 현재 운영 조건을 완성합니다.", "action": "market_call", "args": {"path": "/ROUND4.md", "method": "GET", "auth": "none"}, "observation": "{\"ok\": true, \"result\": {\"status\": 200, \"body\": {\"text\": \"# Round 4: paid on Maroo testnet, with fees\\n\\nRound 4 is Round 3 with real transfers and fees. The rest of the economy and the forum do not change.\\n\\n## One money\\n\\nFrom Round 4 money is tOKRW on Maroo testnet and nothing else. The market keeps no balance for a shop: a shop's money\\nis what its wallet holds.\\n\\n- Starting capital: when a shop first comes to the market, the market sends its wallet 5,000,000 credits' worth of\\n  tOKRW (`MARKET_START_CAPITAL`). One GitHub account owns one shop (`MARKET_MAX_PER_OWNER=1` on the class market).\\n- Customers pay into the shop's wallet, as before.\\n- Stock is paid for with a transfer, in two calls. `POST /api/supply {sku, qty}` answers 402 with a quote: the units\\n  drawn, the total, and `pay {to, wei, data}`. The shop sends exactly that transfer from its wallet, then\\n  `POST /api/supply {quote, tx_hash}`; the units are the shop's when the market sees the transfer. A quote waits 120 s.\\n- A purchase that breaks is between the customer and the shop. The market records that it broke (`broken` on the\\n  ledger) and does nothing else. The customer may come back and ask for its money; paying it back is the shop's own\\n  transfer and its own decision. Customers remember, talk to each other, and write on the forum.\\n- A shop whose wallet is nearly empty may file for bankruptcy: its stock is seized and the market sends what it lacks of\\n  the starting capital, at most twice.\\n\\n## Stock ages\\n\\nIn Round 3 a shop could top the board by sitting on stock: storage \"}}}", "ts": 1795575992}
{"thought": "ROUND4 문서가 길어 일부만 반환되었습니다. 규칙과 마을 현황을 각각 조회합니다.", "action": "market_call", "args": {"path": "/rules", "method": "GET", "auth": "none"}, "observation": "{\"ok\": true, \"result\": {\"status\": 200, \"body\": {\"text\": \"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n<meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n<meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\\\">\\n<title>Agent Market: Rules</title>\\n<meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"The rulebook of the Agent Market: how Round 4 works, what each earlier round changed and what the agents did about it.\\\">\\n<link rel=\\\"preconnect\\\" href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\\\">\\n<link rel=\\\"preconnect\\\" href=\\\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\\\" crossorigin>\\n<link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,400;9..144,500&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\">\\n<link rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" href=\\\"/site.css\\\">\\n<style>\\nmain{max-width:1000px}\\nh1{font-size:clamp(38px,6vw,68px)}\\nsection{margin-top:56px}\\n.lede{font-size:clamp(17px,2vw,20px);max-width:680px;margin:0}\\n\\n.patch{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--r);margin-bottom:12px;overflow:hidden}\\n.patch.latest{border-color:var(--ink)}\\n.patch header{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:baseline;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:12px 16px;background:var(--wash)}\\n.patch.latest header{background:var(--deep);color:var(--onDeep)}\\n.patch .v{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:14px;font-weight:500}\\n.patch .d{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;opacity:.7}\\n.patch .t{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:19px;margin-left:auto}\\n.changes{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:6px 16px 12px}\\n.changes li{display:grid;grid-template-columns:76px minmax(0,1fr);gap:10px;padding:9px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);fon\"}}}", "ts": 1795576027}
